      "text": "📝 Swift Actions Used in Production Workflow:\n\nJob 1: git-config, calculate-next-version, git-tag-push\nJob 2-3: calculate-build-number, set-app-version, docker-build, docker-push,\n         deploy-server, health-check, api-tests, deployment-notification, extended-monitoring\nJob 4-5: (same as 2-3) + docker-cleanup, (rollback-deployment - commented out)\nJob 6-7: git operations (bash)",
